shortdesc Create beautiful scientific Persian/Latin posters using TikZ
longdesc This package is designed for making beautiful scientific
longdesc Persian/Latin posters. It is a fork of baposter by Brian Amberg
longdesc and Reinhold Kainhofer available at LaTeX Poster Template.
longdesc baposter's users should be able to compile their poster using
longdesc xebaposter (instead of baposter) without any problem.
